@startuml
title State Diagram 3 - Reservation Object

hide empty description
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 100

[*] --> PendingPayment : hold(...)\n[flight bookable]

PendingPayment --> Confirmed : confirm(now)\n[payment completed]
PendingPayment -right-> Cancelled : cancel(now)\nor [after 15 min]

Confirmed : modify(newFlight, newSeat, newFare, now)\n[not departed, same route,\nnew flight bookable]
Confirmed -right-> Cancelled : cancel(now)\n[not departed]
Confirmed --> Completed : [when flight has departed]

Cancelled --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

@enduml
